Cell["\<\
Requires at least two layers and one fewer lower block than diagonal blocks.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1983431244,ExpressionUUID->"d6225771-53a4-c640-bf71-8c284657efde"],

Cell["\<\
All self-energies act on the final layer. Returns {G11, G22, ..., Gnn} in the \
original layer order.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1355235607,ExpressionUUID->"44193666-ca74-4d40-a28f-7db5729f2def"],

